<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>R19 双终点触点仓｜运动与公差交互</title><style>
:root{font-family:system-ui,"Noto Sans CJK SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;color:#14314c;background:#edf2f6}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;padding:20px}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto}h1{font-size:24px;margin:4px 0 8px}.sub{color:#63758b;line-height:1.5}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-top:18px}.panel{background:white;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid #dce6ee;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 3px 10px #1231}.panel h2{font-size:18px;margin:4px 0 18px}label{display:block;margin:18px 0 7px}input[type=range]{width:100%}button{padding:7px 12px;border:1px solid #c7d8e3;background:#f8fbfc;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}.chips{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}.state{font-weight:700}.danger{color:#b94745}.good{color:#237b60}.dim{font-size:13px;color:#677b90}svg{max-width:100%;height:auto}kbd{font-size:12px;background:#e8eef3;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 6px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px}td{border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f4;padding:8px 0}td:last-child{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}footer{font-size:12px;margin:15px 0 0;color:#8c5e2a}@media(max-width:750px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style></head><body><main><h1>R19｜双终点接点仓 · 运动约束查看器</h1><div class="sub">A舱固定；B舱由后下方上滑79.75mm，再向前8.2mm。此页面仅是<strong>同参数二维位置示意</strong>，不是可制造3D CAD、真实触点曲线或放行证明。</div><section class="layout"><div class="panel"><h2>双舱俯视位置 · X / Y</h2><svg viewBox="0 0 420 525" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="50" y="25" width="265" height="465" rx="10" fill="#f5f9fb" stroke="#cbdce7"/><g id="parts"></g><text x="338" y="66" font-size="13" fill="#2670a9">A：固定前下舱</text><text x="338" y="88" font-size="13" fill="#cb8130">B：上滑舱</text><text x="338" y="110" font-size="11" fill="#6b8093">橙线：B接点</text><text x="338" y="125" font-size="11" fill="#6b8093">蓝线：A焊盘</text></svg><div class="dim">蓝色接点分别位于A固定站 Y=30 / 84.75mm；B接点位于B局部 Y=30 / 5mm。两端方向不同，分别需要真实缩回机构。</div></div><div class="panel"><h2>控制与安全边界</h2><div class="chips"><button onclick="preset(0,0)">收纳锁定</button><button onclick="preset(39.875,0)">滑动中</button><button onclick="preset(79.75,0)">上滑终点</button><button onclick="preset(79.75,8.2)">齐平终点</button></div><label>纵向滑动 Y：<b id="sy">0.00</b> mm</label><input id="s" type="range" min="0" max="79.75" step=".05" value="0"><label>前后就位 Z：<b id="qz">0.00</b> mm</label><input id="q" type="range" min="0" max="8.2" step=".05" value="0"><label><input id="locked" type="checkbox"> 假设机械锁止已坐实（仅逻辑模拟）</label><label>假设高度公差 ±<b id="tolval">0.25</b> mm</label><input id="tol" type="range" min="0" max="0.3" step=".01" value=".25"><p>状态：<span class="state" id="stage"></span></p><table><tr><td>被许可的接点</td><td id="contact"></td></tr><tr><td>TE公开工作范围</td><td>0.70～1.00mm</td></tr><tr><td>最坏装配高度</td><td id="range"></td></tr><tr><td>数学窗口</td><td id="pass"></td></tr><tr><td>缩回净距（收纳/展开）</td><td>0.50 / 0.35mm</td></tr></table><p class="danger"><b>禁止制造放行。</b> 仅位置+勾选框不能模拟真实承力硬止挡，未建接点执行器及失效常闭机构。</p></div></section><footer>来源：RAZR SLIDE R16/R17几何基线、R18.3公差对抗；TE 2199001-1 页面工作区间；所有未标厂家的安装净距、公差、零件实体都是候选假设。</footer></main><script>
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id),parts=$('parts');function preset(s,q){$('s').value=s;$('q').value=q;$('locked').checked=false;update()}function update(){let s=+$('s').value,q=+$('q').value,t=+$('tol').value;const stow=s<.0001&&q<.0001,open=Math.abs(s-79.75)<.0001&&Math.abs(q-8.2)<.0001;let stage=stow?'收纳端':open?'展开端':'运动／前后就位阶段'; if(q>.0001&&s<79.75-.0001)stage='非法：未滑到终点就前后就位';$('sy').textContent=s.toFixed(2);$('qz').textContent=q.toFixed(2);$('tolval').textContent=t.toFixed(2);$('stage').textContent=stage;$('stage').className=(q>.0001&&s<79.75-.0001)?'state danger':'state';let authorized=$('locked').checked&&(stow||open);$('contact').textContent=authorized?(stow?'收纳站允许接触':'展开站允许接触'):'两端均缩回/隔离';const low=.85-t,high=.85+t;let ok=low>=.7&&high<=1;$('range').textContent=low.toFixed(2)+'～'+high.toFixed(2)+' mm';$('pass').textContent=ok?'仅数学窗口成立':'不成立';$('pass').className=ok?'good':'danger';const y=val=>480-val*2.5;function rec(x,v,width,height,fill,stroke='none'){return `<rect x="${x}" y="${y(v+height)}" width="${width}" height="${height*2.5}" fill="${fill}" stroke="${stroke}" stroke-width="1.5" opacity=".68"/>`};let yy=()=>'';let a=rec(75,0,175,94.25,'#8fc0e0','#348bbf');let b=rec(75,s,175,94.25,'#efc78e','#cd843c');let lines=['<line x1="120" x2="200" y1="'+y(30)+'" y2="'+y(30)+'" stroke="#2b76aa" stroke-width="5"/>','<line x1="120" x2="200" y1="'+y(84.75)+'" y2="'+y(84.75)+'" stroke="#2b76aa" stroke-width="5"/>','<line x1="120" x2="200" y1="'+y(30+s)+'" y2="'+y(30+s)+'" stroke="#d08332" stroke-width="4"/>','<line x1="120" x2="200" y1="'+y(5+s)+'" y2="'+y(5+s)+'" stroke="#d08332" stroke-width="4"/>'];parts.innerHTML=a+b+lines.join('');}for(const id of ['s','q','locked','tol'])$(id).addEventListener('input',update);update();
</script></body></html>
